# Cloudflare Pages deploy-time exclusions.
# `wrangler pages deploy .` uploads the local working directory directly —
# NOT from git — so .gitignore alone does not keep these off the live site.
# This file is the actual mechanism for that. Syntax matches .gitignore.

# Internal docs/tools — never meant to be public (setup guides, internal
# reference docs, generated reports, etc.)
/_private/

# Dino Park's one-off asset-processing/dev-preview scripts. Kept in the
# working directory for future reuse (e.g. re-extracting sprites from a
# new pack) but never served on the live site.
/games/dino-park/_*

# Scratch output from asset extraction/tuning runs at the repo root.
/_test_*.png
/_tile_*.png
/_fence_crop.png

# Local demo package — a standalone zip handed to stakeholders for offline
# preview, not part of the live site. Also well over Cloudflare Pages'
# 25 MiB per-file upload limit, so this actually blocks deploy if included.
/PhantomACE-Demo.zip
/START_DEMO.bat
/start-demo.bat
/demo-server.js
